Description: Enable Wayland session restore on GNOME again.
 Mozilla bug 2070815 disabled it on GNOME because of the name_in_use protocol error from Mutter, which
 wayland-session-restore-new-ids.patch fixes. Session restore stays disabled where GTK 3 lacks the
 xdg-toplevel-realized signal, by the check right after the removed one.
Author: Mitar
Bug: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2064100
Forwarded: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340272
Last-Update: 2026-11-06
